#: main.cpp:27
msgid "KDE's application finder"
msgstr "Canfyddydd cymhwysiad KDE"

#: main.cpp:30
msgid "Install .desktop files into directory <dir>"
msgstr "Gosod ffeiliau .desktop yn y cyfeiriadur <dir>"

#: main.cpp:36 toplevel.cpp:49
msgid "KAppfinder"
msgstr "KAppfinder"

#: toplevel.cpp:52
msgid ""
"The application finder looks for legacy applications on your system and adds "
"them to the KDE menu system. Click 'Scan' to begin, select the desired "
"applications and then click 'Apply'."
msgstr ""
"Mae'r canfyddydd cymhwysiant yn chwilio am gymhwysiadau etifeddiaeth ar eich "
"cysawd, ac mae'n eu ychwanegu i'r gyfundrefn ddewislen KDE.  Cliciwch ar "
"\"Syllu\" i ddechrau, dewis y cymhwysiadau penodol, ac wedyn cliciwch "
"'Gweithredu'."

#: toplevel.cpp:62
msgid "Application"
msgstr "Cymhwysiad"

#: toplevel.cpp:63
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Disgrifiad"

#: toplevel.cpp:64
msgid "Command"
msgstr "Gorchymyn"

#: toplevel.cpp:75
msgid "Summary:"
msgstr "Crynodeb:"

#: toplevel.cpp:84
msgid "Unselect All"
msgstr "Dad-ddewis Popeth"

#: toplevel.cpp:90
msgid "Scan"
msgstr "Syllu"

#: toplevel.cpp:244
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: Summary: found %n application\n"
"Summary: found %n applications"
msgstr ""
"Crynodeb: canfuwyd %n cymhwysiad\n"
"Crynodeb: canfuwyd %n o gymhwysiadau"

#: toplevel.cpp:287
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: %n application was added to the KDE menu system.\n"
"%n applications were added to the KDE menu system."
msgstr ""
"Ychwanegwyd %n cymhwysiad i'r gyfundrefn ddewislen KDE.\n"
"Ychwanegwyd %n o gymhwysiadau i'r gyfundrefn ddewislen KDE."

